{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2c48f1f8c52081ec971f4223738035bf911518fb96563e006bbc663e1b4c5ae3", "ja": "（星梨花のコスプレグラビア企画で、キツネを\n題材にした本の販促イベントを行うことになった）", "zh": "（星梨花的角色扮演写真企划决定举办一场以狐狸为主题的书籍宣传活动。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "5c823a3a1c9ed8dc94282e88f5af1f5c37c6b1c1359f2818cf8ca7952b29fef9", "ja": "わあ……！　キツネさんが出ている本って\nこんなにたくさんあるんですね。", "zh": "哇……！有小狐狸出场的书，\n原来有这么多啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "38cd68de38321b6b238a14fe97137000ff03e3b5c23677e2b9f1e2dad1e9889d", "ja": "わたしが知らない本もいっぱいあります。\n童話集、小説、漫画、絵本……あっ！", "zh": "还有好多书是我不知道的呢。\n童话集、小说、漫画、绘本……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "70faf32f2b5861645e5cff49ba8b43011a64f306b8a4e33a02e22fb654d3066f", "ja": "キツネさんのことを書いた本もありますよ。これを\n読んだら、キツネさんのことが、もっとわかりますか？", "zh": "也有很多关于狐狸的书哦。读了这些书之后，是不是就能更了解狐狸了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a9c76746c8bc972b915b5986e3b03521e9b904b5c37f6129cf3125b8a2353caa", "ja": "ああ、そうかもしれないな。\n星梨花はキツネのことが知りたいのか？", "zh": "啊，或许是吧。\n星梨花想了解狐狸吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "99f7e095709296ec43b8522d75e718500fb38c275b411e170c6c2678c4849f16", "ja": "はい。キツネさんになるためには、\nキツネさんのことを知らないとダメですから。", "zh": "是的。因为想成为狐狸小姐，就必须了解狐狸才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "e909f68b7a69eb145bb427f8085097fa860a11eb18a1f3c2968402c10f513ae2", "ja": "それに、お話やイラストのキツネさんはよく見ますけど\n動物のキツネさんは、あんまり知らないなって。", "zh": "而且，故事和插画里的狐狸经常能看到，\n但对于真正的狐狸，我还不太了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7777d608c2d67ad7e2d031fd247876cfee0aa967504e8a228f7b3838b40fd26f", "ja": "確かに……。題材に使われることは多いけど、\n実際の生態となるとわからないよな……。", "zh": "确实……。狐狸作为题材倒是很常见，\n但说到它们实际的生态习性，还真不太了解……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "a14fd8ba1628314587653b30060ce424d9ea0e8056a180d5809d79985d29a31e", "ja": "{$P$}さんもですか？\nわたしと一緒ですね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是吗？\n和我一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b8a221f1f0591da60cd1825ccf14268f303f68b76b5edbd90071562d4746b3f", "ja": "そうだ！　わたしと一緒に勉強しませんか？　この本を\n全部読んだら、キツネさんマスターになれますよね！", "zh": "对了！要不要和我一起学习？把这本书全部读完的话，就能成为狐狸专家了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d39d1950497bc0f9d35879caf24923fd43709a1fc3fdc0f08f175fedece96f3d", "ja": "そうだな。全部読むのは大変だから、\nまず店員さんにオススメを聞いてみようか。", "zh": "是啊。要全部读完也挺费劲的，先去问问店员有没有推荐的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1011_p", "source_sha256": "30dd82b113c42f0ad04f75c7cbc8d9bb98dd6d6a215a998643a8d1c0ca444ba2", "ja": "このあとのイベントでも役立つかもしれないし。", "zh": "说不定在接下来的活动中也能派上用场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "ef042d9c5e19e4fb3c1e75556bd1947cc3b95cc3d231f81d33a91f581954d2fa", "ja": "それならわたし、小さい子に向けた本と、\n大人の人に向けた本も知りたいです！", "zh": "这样的话，我还想了解面向小孩子的书，以及面向大人的书！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "a5905d1ae8cdb994c4f7de97c3e4744ad1146e1842d4f662fa729f3013fb50f9", "ja": "本屋さんにはいろんな人が来ますから。みなさんに、\nキツネさんをもっと好きになってほしいです！", "zh": "书店里会来各种各样的人。所以，我希望大家都能更喜欢狐狸先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3e0990682b80477c4440ae85a57ddebe088cc6c4797dcfdc67d75f7bfad2d357", "ja": "うん、星梨花の言うとおりだな。\nじゃあ、店員さんに話を聞きにいこう。", "zh": "嗯，正如星梨花所说。\n那我们去找店员了解一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "41f4a5aa9abcfdff082a8e9ead4aefd3495c40523319cfea959140f248930469", "ja": "はい、行きましょう！　みなさんにキツネさんのことを\n知ってもらえるように、いっぱい勉強しますね♪", "zh": "好，我们走吧！为了让大家了解狐狸先生，我会好好学习的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0583_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e2ce6489afd5c05007bb9e0ce66526fd139c485168779afaa1fd531a27beb279", "ja": "（本番中、星梨花は楽しそうにキツネの話をしていた。\n用意した本は完売し、イベントは大成功に終わった）", "zh": "（正式演出中，星梨花开心地讲着狐狸的故事。准备的书全部售罄，活动圆满成功）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
